          "worked": "Use degree mode and $30'=\\frac{30}{60}^\\circ$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan22^\\circ30'&=\\tan\\left(22+\\frac{30}{60}\\right)^\\circ\\\\\\tan22^\\circ30'&\\approx0.41.\\end{align*}$$",
